              column_labels.font.weight = "bold", row_group.font.weight = "bold") %>%
  tab_source_note("PRIMARY ANALYSIS (covariate-adjusted, full landmark cohort). OR > 1 indicates higher odds of graft failure in year 2 relative to the comparison group. Adjusted model controls for recipient age, gender, MELD score, cold ischemic time, and diabetes status. HLA mismatch is NOT included: it is missing for roughly 60% of the cohort and, because model fitting is complete-case, including it would restrict the adjusted models to a minority of patients selected on HLA-typing availability. N is reported per model so any remaining difference in analysed sample between the unadjusted and adjusted rows is visible. Landmark cohort restricted to patients with a functioning graft through 1 year (GRF_TIME_DAYS >= 365.25). See section 25 for a propensity-matched sensitivity analysis of the same comparisons.")

